From: mscharged-port
Subject: Recharged's trophy room: a set's match goes in from the trophy
Upstream-base: 8b9d92dd88b4c727cc6359ee4cd5ba128cced7b8

A set started in Recharged's trophy room (src/platform/trophy_room.cpp)
is a RANKED match, a friendly match to the game (GM_FRIENDLY with a
flag): the loading scene's 3D transition plays the friendly match's
StartOnlineGrudgeMatchSequence, which starts from the online menu's
camera, and from the room the camera stayed on the trophy until the game
loaded.

The cut online tournament went into its games from the same trophy with
its fe_presentation function TransitionOnlineTournamentToGame: the camera
to trophychoosesides, the captains' holograms on their light cones (the
function TransitionCupToChooseSides calls too), their trapdoor, the
trophy let go. A new hook, mscharged_tweak_trophy_room_to_game, has the
loading scene play it for such a match instead; the scene waits for it,
as for the other sequences, before the front end goes.

diff --git a/include/mscharged_tweaks.h b/include/mscharged_tweaks.h
--- a/include/mscharged_tweaks.h
+++ b/include/mscharged_tweaks.h
@@ -230,6 +230,11 @@
 // shows the front end's world in its place, and its buttons, its Back and
 // its friends' invitations do nothing meanwhile.
 bool mscharged_tweak_online_menu_held(void);
+// A match of a set started in Recharged's trophy room: the loading scene's
+// 3D transition plays the cut online tournament's way into its games
+// (TransitionOnlineTournamentToGame: the captains' holograms before the
+// trophy) instead of the friendly match's sequence.
+bool mscharged_tweak_trophy_room_to_game(void);
 // While the host draws the pause menu, a player's cursor (wiicursor.fen's
 // cursor0-3) is drawn by the host on top of it: the front end marks the
 // cursor's drawing (begin returns the state for end) and hands its pictures
diff --git a/src/Game/SH/SHLoading.cpp b/src/Game/SH/SHLoading.cpp
--- a/src/Game/SH/SHLoading.cpp
+++ b/src/Game/SH/SHLoading.cpp
@@ -34,6 +34,7 @@
 #include "Game/FE/FEAudio.h"
 #if defined(MSCHARGED_TWEAKS)
 #include "Game/FE/feTextureResource.h"
+#include "mscharged_tweaks.h"
 #endif
 
 static void DisplayBestOfText(MatchLoadingScene* scene, TLTextInstance* text, int numGames);
@@ -157,6 +158,14 @@
         GameInfoManager* gameInfo = GameInfoManager::Instance();
         if (gameInfo->mIsOnlineMode)
         {
+#if defined(MSCHARGED_TWEAKS)
+            // Recharged's trophy room: a set's RANKED match (a friendly
+            // match to the game: RANKED is only a flag) goes into its game as
+            // the cut tournament's did, from the trophy.
+            if (mscharged_tweak_trophy_room_to_game())
+                FrontEndPresentation::GetInstance()->Call("TransitionOnlineTournamentToGame");
+            else
+#endif
             if (gameInfo->mCurrentMode == GameInfoManager::GM_FRIENDLY)
